{"slug": "studio-user-guide", "title": "Barkpark — operator's guide", "blocks": [{"id": "b1", "type": "ingress", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "For people who edit content in Barkpark Studio (not for developers)."}]}, {"id": "b2", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "What Barkpark is"}, {"id": "b3", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "A headless CMS. You edit documents of whatever types your team modelled — "}, {"type": "text", "value": "post", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ", "}, {"type": "text", "value": "page", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ", "}, {"type": "text", "value": "product", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " — in the multi-pane Studio at "}, {"type": "text", "value": "/w/<ws>/p/<proj>/d/<dataset>/studio", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": "; "}, {"type": "text", "value": "/studio/<dataset>", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " redirects there for your session. Plugins add specialised editors on top; the ONIX book editor below is one."}]}, {"id": "b4", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Content hierarchy: "}, {"type": "text", "value": "Workspace → Project → Dataset → Documents", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ". Most teams have one workspace. Legacy content moved to a Default workspace and project automatically; old links still work."}]}, {"id": "b5", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Navigation — the desk"}, {"id": "b6", "type": "code", "value": "+--------------+-----------------+-----------+---------------------------------+\n|  Structure   |  All Post       |  p1       |  Editor pane: p1                |\n|  Content     |  drafts.post-…  |  post-…   |  [tabs] [violations]            |\n|  …           |                 |           |  fields…                        |\n+--------------+-----------------+-----------+---------------------------------+"}, {"id": "b7", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Click left-to-right to drill. Each pane is its own URL segment, so a Studio URL reopens the same document for anyone you share it with."}]}, {"id": "b8", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Tab not in URL:", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " the active editor tab lives in the LiveView socket, NOT the URL. A shared link always lands on the default tab. Desk filter chips ("}, {"type": "text", "value": "?desk=drafts", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ") DO live in the URL and are shareable."}]}, {"id": "b9", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Editing any content type"}, {"id": "b10", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Your own types appear in the Structure pane under "}, {"type": "text", "value": "Content", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ", the group for every type no curated group or plugin claims; a type with no documents yet still shows. Click it for its document list, then a document to open the editor."}]}, {"id": "b11", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Create:", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " Structure → your type → "}, {"type": "text", "value": "+", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " → fill the fields → Publish when ready."}]}, {"id": "b12", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Fix a typo in a published document:", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " open it → edit any field (Studio auto-creates a draft) → click Diff for the field-level changes → click Publish."}]}, {"id": "b13", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Bulk publish/unpublish:", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " check rows in the document list → floating action bar appears."}]}, {"id": "b14", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Book editor — ONIX plugin only"}, {"id": "b15", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Everything in this section needs the OnixEdit plugin enabled."}]}, {"id": "b16", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "47 ONIX fields in 8 tabs: Core · Descriptive · Contributors · Subjects · Marketing · Publishing · Supply & Pricing · Status. The ONIX 3.0 XML preview updates live beside them."}]}, {"id": "b17", "type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "Importing an ONIX feed"}, {"id": "b18", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "SSH procedure:"}]}, {"id": "b19", "type": "code", "value": "ssh root@89.167.28.206\ncd /opt/barkpark/api\nsource /root/.asdf/asdf.sh\nset -a; source ../.env; set +a\n\nmix onix.import path/to/feed.xml --dry-run   # preview first\nmix onix.import path/to/feed.xml             # creates drafts"}, {"id": "b20", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Each "}, {"type": "text", "value": "<Product>", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " becomes a draft book; "}, {"type": "text", "value": "doc_id", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " derives from "}, {"type": "text", "value": "<RecordReference>", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " (host prefix stripped), else the first "}, {"type": "text", "value": "<IDValue>", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ", else a random "}, {"type": "text", "value": "imported-<n>", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ". Round-trip is byte-stable: export → import → re-export produces identical XML (modulo "}, {"type": "text", "value": "<SentDateTime>", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ")."}]}, {"id": "b21", "type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "Bokbasen submission"}, {"id": "b22", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "Publish to Bokbasen", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " button (book only): two-stage modal (dry-run → real). Fix violations first: the "}, {"type": "text", "value": "isbn_xor_gtin", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " cross-validation is an "}, {"type": "text", "value": "error", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " (blocks submission); "}, {"type": "text", "value": "price_currency_required", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " is a "}, {"type": "text", "value": "warning", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ". Status pill: "}, {"type": "text", "value": "draft → pending → staging → staged → polling → accepted", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ". On rejection: "}, {"type": "text", "value": "bp_export_status.last_error", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " has Bokbasen's message."}]}, {"id": "b23", "type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "Thema picker"}, {"id": "b24", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "themaSubjectCategory", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ": ~9,000 hierarchical subject categories. Search input + scrollable tree; click a node to expand, a leaf to select."}]}, {"id": "b25", "type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "\"(no codelist registered)\" field"}, {"id": "b26", "type": "code", "value": "# dev box\nmix run -e 'Barkpark.Codelists.EDItEUR.seed_bundled()'\n\n# prod — restart restores it via post-boot seeder\nsystemctl restart barkpark"}, {"id": "b27", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Editor header actions"}, {"id": "b28", "type": "table", "head": [[{"type": "text", "value": "Button"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "What"}]], "rows": [[[{"type": "text", "value": "History"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "Past revisions; restore via "}, {"type": "text", "value": "POST /v1/data/revision/:dataset/:id/restore", "marks": ["code"]}]], [[{"type": "text", "value": "Delete"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "Remove doc (confirm; checks references)"}]], [[{"type": "text", "value": "Publish / Unpublish"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "Standard draft flow"}]], [[{"type": "text", "value": "Hide/Show XML"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "Toggle ONIX 3.0 preview pane (book only)"}]], [[{"type": "text", "value": "Diff"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "Field-level diff table (drafts with a published twin only)"}]], [[{"type": "text", "value": "Duplicate"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "Clone as new draft titled \"<original> (copy)\""}]], [[{"type": "text", "value": "Open another"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "Load a second doc side-by-side (read-only)"}]], [[{"type": "text", "value": "Export ONIX"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "Download ONIX 3.0 XML (book only)"}]]]}, {"id": "b29", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "URL reference"}, {"id": "b30", "type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "value": "P", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " stands for "}, {"type": "text", "value": "/w/<ws>/p/<proj>/d/<dataset>", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": ":"}]}, {"id": "b31", "type": "code", "value": "P/studio                    → the canonical Studio URL\nP/studio/<type>             → all documents of a type\nP/studio/<type>?desk=drafts → only drafts\nP/studio/<type>/<doc-id>    → editor\n/studio[/<dataset>/...]     → 302 to your scoped Studio\n/admin/onixedit/staleness   → book sync status (ONIX)"}, {"id": "b32", "type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Getting help"}, {"id": "b33", "type": "list", "ordered": false, "items": [[{"type": "text", "value": "Schema questions:", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " schema-v2.md"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "Plugin setup:", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " plugins.md"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "Bokbasen:", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " bokbasen-go-live.md"}], [{"type": "text", "value": "Field tests:", "marks": ["strong"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " grep "}, {"type": "text", "value": "api/test/barkpark_web/components/fields/", "marks": ["code"]}, {"type": "text", "value": " for the field type"}]]}], "related": ["contracts-schema-v2", "cards-plugins", "ops-bokbasen-go-live"]}
